      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "test(agents): register session lock helpers in vitest workers",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe latest mainline node compact shards can import `src/agents/session-write-lock.test-support.ts` inside Vitest worker environments where `process.env.VITEST` is not set at module evaluation time. `session-write-lock.ts` therefore skips registering `openclaw.sessionWriteLockTestApi`, and the test-support module fails at import time with `TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'testing')`.\\n\\nThis blocks unrelated PRs, including #108010, in `checks-node-compact-large-4` and `checks-node-compact-large-5`.\\n\\nThe fix keeps production behavior unchanged and expands the existing test-only registration guard to also recognize `VITEST_WORKER_ID`, which is set for Vitest worker processes.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\nExact-head proof for `99b523ad1548584bda94202f43d6c3d69811f2bf`:\\n\\n- `PATH=\"/Users/xjch/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/bin:$PATH\" node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/gateway/server-startup.test.ts src/gateway/server-startup-session-migration.test.ts src/auto-reply/reply/get-reply.fast-path.test.ts` -> gateway startup shards passed; auto-reply advanced past the previous `getTestApi().testing` import failure and was then blocked locally by bundled Node v24.14.0 / SQLite 3.51.2 WAL safety, which CI does not use.\\n- `PATH=\"/Users/xjch/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/bin:$PATH\" ./node_modules/.bin/oxfmt --check --threads=1 src/agents/session-write-lock.ts` -> passed\\n- `PATH=\"/Users/xjch/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/dependencies/node/bin:$PATH\" ./node_modules/.bin/oxlint src/agents/session-write-lock.ts` -> passed\\n- `git diff --check` -> passed\\n\\nObserved CI failure this targets:\\n\\n- #108010 `checks-node-compact-large-4`: `src/agents/session-write-lock.test-support.ts:44:36 TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'testing')`\\n- #108010 `checks-node-compact-large-5`: same import-time failure in auto-reply shard\\n",
        "branch": "fix/session-write-lock-vitest-worker-api",
